{"claim_ref": "book_0109::lead_book_0109_1_045", "verdict": "corroboration", "behavior_id": "mean_reversion_band", "page": 67, "exact_text": "When volatility is at extremes, it can be a reversal\nsignal. Traders view high volatility as a sell signal and low volatility as a buy\nsignal.", "added_conditions": ["volatility at extremes"], "added_parameters": []},
