{"claim_ref": "book_0109::lead_book_0109_1_053", "verdict": "corroboration", "behavior_id": "support_resistance_bounce", "page": 67, "exact_text": "Support is where the price stops falling and comes to a temporary rest.", "added_conditions": [], "added_parameters": []},
